  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El Nino Response Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The El Nino weather condition, affected the 2023/24 agriculture season resulting in reduced crop production, and ultimately resulted in 5.7 million people in Malawi becoming food insecure. This support aims to contribute to WFPS effort of providing humanitarian assistance to 2.1 million people through in-kind assistance and cash based transfers. The overall goal of the the Malawi&apos;s National Humanitarian Response Programme is &quot;food and nutrition insecure populations in malawi, affected by shocks, are able to meet their food and nutrition needs and have improved education outcomes for enganced human capital development.</narrative>
  </description>
